    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etaaraki enkaji e Saul metuata",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netii apa olameyu too nkolong'i e Daudi too larin okuni, to lari ake o to lari, neing'oru Daudi enkomom o Laitoriani. Nejo Olaitoriani, “Etii entorroni o sarge shumata Saul o shumata enkaji enye, enkaraki natara Ilgibioni metuata.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.9.3+JOS.9.4+JOS.9.5+JOS.9.6+JOS.9.7+JOS.9.8+JOS.9.9+JOS.9.10+JOS.9.11+JOS.9.12+JOS.9.13+JOS.9.14+JOS.9.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yosh 9.3-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neaku eipoto olaiguanani Ilgibioni. Ore apa Ilgibioni neme iloo ltung'ana le Israel, kake ilo lpisiai loo Lamori; hoo neinosa iltung'ana le Israel olmumai pee eleku ninche, etonyuaa Saul ear ninche metuata te ina nyuata enye te nkaraki iltung'ana le Israel o Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Daudi lelo Gibioni, “Kaa nanu aitaas intae? Naa kaji nanu aikunu enkipooto, pee itumutumu intae aatamayian enjung'ore o Laitoriani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ilgibioni ninye, “Mme mbae e nkosholai arashu sahabu erishata ang o Saul arashu enkaji enye; neme enaang pee kiar oltung'ani metua te Israel.” Nejo ninye, “Ijojo intae pee aitaas aa nanu intae?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ninche olaiguanani, “Ore ilo tung'ani apa otumuta iyiook neitobir pee eidaikie iyiook, metaa mikitum iyiook ewueji ti atua enkop pooki oo Siraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nchoo meishori ilayiok lenyena oopishana pee kisiong iyiook ninche te dukuya Olaitoriani te Gibeon to ldoinyo lo Laitoriani.” Nejo olaiguanani, “Kaishoru nanu ninche.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
