          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.20.15+1SA.20.16+1SA.20.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 20.15-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.9.1+2SA.9.2+2SA.9.3+2SA.9.4+2SA.9.5+2SA.9.6+2SA.9.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 9.1-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kake etelekua olaiguanani Mefiboshet, olayioni lo layioni le Saul, Yonatan, te nkaraki olmumai lo Laitoriani apa otii erishata ninche, o erishata e Daudi, o Yonatan olayioni le Saul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.18.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 18.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neya olaiguanani ilayiok oare le Rispa entito e Aia apa naa ninye etoikio Saul, Armon o Mefiboshet; o layiok imiet le Merab entito e Saul laa ninche etoikio Adriel olayioni le Barsilai ilo Meholati; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neishooyo ninche apik atua nkaik oo Lgibioni; neilili ninche teilo doinyo te dukuya Olaitoriani, ore ninche pokira oopishana neidak te nebo. Neari ninche metuata too nkolong'i e dukuya e nkisampuare, te nkiterunoto e nkisampuare e shairi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Rispa entito e Aia aya ilkuniyiani neisalaashaki te ndapidapoi ebaiki enkiterunoto e nkisampuare o metaba anaa neshaiki enchan ninche eing'uaa shumata; neitu ninye eisho imotonyi o loing'ang'e epuonu aadoiki ninche te ndama, arashu ing'uesi e ong'ata te nkewarie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee elikini Daudi enataasa Rispa entito e Aia ina apiani e Saul, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.31.8+1SA.31.9+1SA.31.10+1SA.31.11+1SA.31.12+1SA.31.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 31.8-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nelo Daudi aitayu iloik le Saul o loik lo layioni lenye Yonatan ti atua iltung'ana le Yabesh-gilead, apa ootupurroitie ninche to lkurroto otumoreki te Bet-shan, te ine apa neililiyie Ilfilisti ninche, te ina olong apa nataara Ilfilisti Saul metua te Gilboa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neyau ninye ailepunye te ine iloik le Saul o loik lo layioni lenye Yonatan; neiturrur ninche iloik le lelo apa oo lilioki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenukaa ninche iloik le Saul o layioni lenye Yonatan te nkop e Benchamen te Sela, ti atua enkurare e Kish papaai lenye; neas ninche nena pooki naaitanapishe olaiguanani. Ore te siadi ina nening Enkai eomonokinoto te nkaraki enkop.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Olarrabal o ltung'ana sapuki loo Filisti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenyaakitia apa Ilfilisti aata olarrabal o Israel, nedoyio Daudi alo te nebo isinkan lenyena nearare ninche Ilfilisti; neilepunye Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore Ishbi-benob, obo apa le ishoi e lelo tung'ana sapuki laa shekeli iip o suyai enkirroishi e mpere enye, oenita olalem ng'ejuk, neing'oru pee ear Daudi metua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.11.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Int 11.36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.132.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Olke 132.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kake eewuo Abishai olayioni le Seruiya aretu, nerasaki ilo Filisti near ninye metua. Neitirrishaki iltung'ana le Daudi ninye aajoki, “Mintoki aekata iyie aipang alo te nebo iyiook olarrabal, pee miar ake olkilang'ilang'et le Israel.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te siadi ena neitoki atii olarrabal apa o Lfilisti te Gob; neari metua Sibekai ol Husati Saf, laa ninye apa obo le ishoi e lelo tung'ana sapuki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neetae ake sii apa olarrabal o Lfilisti te Gob; neari Elhanan olayioni le Yaareoregim, le Betlehem near metua Goliat le Giti oba enchata e mpere enye anaa embokishi o lashetani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neetae sii apa olarrabal te Gas, teine apa netii oltung'ani sapuk oado oata lkimojik ile te pooki aina, o nkimojik ile te pooki keju, tikitam o ong'uan esiana e pooki; naa ole ishoi sii apa ninye e lelo tung'ana sapuki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee edek ninye Israel near ninye metua Yonatan olayioni le Shimei, ilo alashe le Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore kulo oong'uan naa ile ishoi e lelo tung'ana apa sapuki ootii Gas; near Daudi te nkaina enye o te nkaina oo sinkan lenyena metuata.",
